---
title: Visual Artifact Subsystem
---
flowchart LR
    User([User]) --> UI[Chat and artifact UI]
    Forget([Delete all personal memory])
    UI --> Guard[Owned visual API<br/>limits and integrity]
    MCP([Confirmed MCP call]) -.-> Guard
    Guard --> Route{Requested capability}

    Route -->|diagram| Diagram[Qwen 3.5 4B<br/>validated Mermaid]
    Route -->|new or edit| Image[HiDream generation<br/>or FLUX source edit]
    Route -->|analyze| Inspect[Qwen 3.5 4B<br/>one structured inspection]
    Route -->|recall| Recall[Explicit image ID or Qwen<br/>semantic visual selection]

    Inspect --> Evidence{Evidence result}
    Evidence -->|answerable| Vision[Grounded answer]
    Evidence -->|mixed or insufficient| Limit[Per-item confidence<br/>store only high-confidence evidence]
    Evidence -->|safety-sensitive| Safety[Strict uncertainty]
    Evidence -->|model uncertain| Specialist[Optional specialist VLM<br/>one retry]
    Specialist --> Vision
    Limit --> Repository
    Safety --> Repository

    Diagram --> Repository[Owned artifact repository]
    Image --> Repository
    Image -->|observe edited pixels| Vision
    Vision --> Repository
    Repository -->|artifact and derived-index lifecycle| Store[(PostgreSQL metadata and lineage<br/>opaque private files)]
    Repository --> Embed[Nomic pixel and<br/>text embeddings]
    Embed --> Store
    Store --> Recall
    Recall --> Context[Owner-validated<br/>bounded visual context]
    Context --> UI
    Repository --> UI
    Forget --> Cleanup[Owned bulk deletion]
    Cleanup --> Repository

    classDef interface fill:#f5f5f7,stroke:#86868b,color:#1d1d1f;
    classDef application fill:#e8f1fb,stroke:#5e8fc4,color:#102a43;
    classDef data fill:#eef7ee,stroke:#5f9562,color:#183b1b;
    classDef external fill:#f1edff,stroke:#8872c6,color:#2e2450;
    class User,UI,MCP,Forget interface;
    class Guard,Route,Evidence,Repository,Context,Cleanup,Limit,Safety application;
    class Store data;
    class Diagram,Image,Inspect,Specialist,Vision,Recall,Embed external;
